            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-128] pom and script modifications required for generating release packages</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-128</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;These got missed with &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-41&quot; title=&quot;Generation of packages for distribution.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;BOOKKEEPER-41&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;BOOKKEEPER-41&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. It&apos;s basically a maven assembly file, and making bookkeeper and hedwig scripts executable. Also, for the servers, make log4j and the slf4j log4j adapter, real dependencies, so logging can be enabled.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
